spice
* PMOS Transistor M1
M1 3 7 3 PMOS

* NMOS Transistor M2
M2 2 5 6 NMOS

* Current Source I1
I1 2 6 DC <value>

* Voltage Sources
VDD 3 0 DC <supply_voltage>

* Input Voltage
Vin 7 0 DC <input_voltage>

* Bias Voltage for M2
Vb 5 0 DC <bias_voltage>

* Define Models for Simulation
.model PMOS PMOS (level=1 <other_parameters>)
.model NMOS NMOS (level=1 <other_parameters>)

.END